    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's an interesting point about the clash between collectivist and individualistic cultures. Could you expand on that a bit? Specifically, in cases where a historically white, middle-class neighborhood sees a sudden influx of a large, non-European immigrant population, what are the specific risks to the \"neighborhood character\" or the perceived social harmony during that transition? I want to understand the friction points from a policy perspective.",
