      "content": "That's a lot of heavy variables to consider. Looking at those specific friction points like the changes in customs or the shift in local business types, would you say that some demographics are inherently more \"difficult\" to integrate into these established Western urban environments than others? I'm trying to figure out if certain cultural profiles are just more naturally prone to disrupting the stability of these types of communities.",
